* Bybit hack, 21 Feb 2025
** Attack chain
*** Safe developer's Mac compromised (4 Feb)
*** Malicious JavaScript in the Safe{Wallet} S3 bucket
*** Signers blind-sign a delegatecall
*** masterCopy (slot 0) set to the backdoor
** On-chain
*** 14:13:35 UTC: masterCopy replaced
*** 14:16:11 UTC: sweepETH, 401,347 ETH
*** 90,376 stETH, 15,000 cmETH, 8,000 mETH
*** About 1.46B USD in total
** Laundering
*** THORChain: about 361,255 ETH
*** eXch: about 79,655 ETH
*** 4 Mar 2025: 77% traceable, 20% dark, 3% frozen
** Response
*** ETH gap closed in three days (about 446,870 ETH)
*** Bounty up to about 140M USD
*** 8 Aug 2026: 48.4M recovered, 30.5M frozen (5.3%)
*** FBI: TraderTraitor (North Korea)
** Compared with other exchange hacks
*** 2.7x Coincheck (2018)
*** Since 2024: the signing process, not the keys
*** DMM Bitcoin, WazirX, Bitget, Binance 2026
*** Binance 2026: about 6.3B USD, stablecoins frozen
@endmindmap
